                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Source: Google GA4 obfuscated ecommerce sample | Nov 2020–Jan 2021 | 10,000 sessions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>KPIs and funnel follow the device filter; the device comparison always shows all devices.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Funnel: View item → Add to cart → Begin checkout → Purchase, in order within one session.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontsize='10'>Tablet: 214 product-view sessions and 12 funnel purchases. Observed differences do not establish causation.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
